pipewire-configurator-simple (2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rework around drop-in files: only the configurator's own files are written.
  * Per-device output and input settings, Bluetooth settings and per-application
    rules (WirePlumber 0.5).
  * Quantum limit is also written to the client configurations.
  * Qt Widgets interface, new icon.

